WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.958 --> 00:00:30.333
In the previous verse, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:33.291
explained the highest form of devotion,

3
00:00:33.291 --> 00:00:35.750
where the devotee keeps both mind

4
00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:37.541
and intellect fully fixed

5
00:00:37.541 --> 00:00:39.375
in Lord Krishna

6
00:00:39.375 --> 00:00:41.416
and resides in Him alone.

7
00:00:41.416 --> 00:00:43.958
But Lord Krishna knows

8
00:00:43.958 --> 00:00:47.250
that reaching this level of devotion is not easy.

9
00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:49.250
It takes time.

10
00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:53.166
So now He describes the next level of devotion.

11
00:00:53.166 --> 00:00:55.166
As if, having drawn us

12
00:00:55.166 --> 00:00:57.125
toward the highest level,

13
00:00:57.125 --> 00:01:00.208
He is now saying – do not worry.

14
00:01:00.208 --> 00:01:03.250
There is a path to reach there too.

15
00:01:07.916 --> 00:01:10.125
The highest level of devotion is

16
00:01:10.125 --> 00:01:12.958
keeping both mind and intellect fully

17
00:01:12.958 --> 00:01:15.000
fixed in Lord Krishna

18
00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.208
and residing in Him.

19
00:01:17.208 --> 00:01:19.666
But Lord Krishna knows

20
00:01:19.666 --> 00:01:23.166
that this level cannot be reached immediately.

21
00:01:23.166 --> 00:01:25.208
Giving its solution,

22
00:01:25.208 --> 00:01:27.041
He tells Arjuna

23
00:01:27.041 --> 00:01:29.000
that if keeping your mind

24
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:32.333
continuously centred on Me seems difficult,

25
00:01:32.333 --> 00:01:35.666
then simply, with sincerity and regularity,

26
00:01:35.666 --> 00:01:37.541
practise devotion,

27
00:01:37.541 --> 00:01:38.250
and in this way

28
00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:42.500
keep developing a strong desire to attain Me.

29
00:01:42.500 --> 00:01:43.333
Here Lord Krishna

30
00:01:43.333 --> 00:01:46.625
addresses Arjuna as Dhananjaya.

31
00:01:46.625 --> 00:01:50.458
Dhananjaya, the one who has won wealth.

32
00:01:50.458 --> 00:01:51.833
As if saying

33
00:01:51.833 --> 00:01:54.833
that Arjuna, you have won material wealth,

34
00:01:54.833 --> 00:01:55.833
but now is the time

35
00:01:55.833 --> 00:01:59.083
to win true wealth, because true wealth

36
00:01:59.083 --> 00:02:02.666
is not material but spiritual, and that wealth is

37
00:02:02.666 --> 00:02:03.625
devotion,

38
00:02:03.625 --> 00:02:07.791
an unwavering resolve to attain Lord Krishna.

39
00:02:07.791 --> 00:02:09.250
Here Lord Krishna is suggesting

40
00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:12.416
abhyasa yoga, that is,

41
00:02:12.416 --> 00:02:15.083
engaging regularly in those activities

42
00:02:15.083 --> 00:02:16.833
and practices of devotion

43
00:02:16.833 --> 00:02:19.666
that gradually purify the mind,

44
00:02:19.666 --> 00:02:20.833
and by which

45
00:02:20.833 --> 00:02:21.958
the desire to attain

46
00:02:21.958 --> 00:02:24.958
Lord Krishna keeps deepening.

47
00:02:24.958 --> 00:02:27.083
The core message is this – that if

48
00:02:27.083 --> 00:02:28.291
for any of us

49
00:02:28.291 --> 00:02:29.250
keeping the mind

50
00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:30.833
continuously in Lord Krishna

51
00:02:30.833 --> 00:02:32.750
seems difficult,

52
00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:35.250
then we should not be disheartened.

53
00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:38.458
We must simply spend some time each day

54
00:02:38.458 --> 00:02:41.541
in regular and simple acts of devotion,

55
00:02:41.541 --> 00:02:43.958
such as chanting the Lord's name,

56
00:02:43.958 --> 00:02:46.541
listening to bhajan and hari katha,

57
00:02:46.541 --> 00:02:50.333
studying scripture, offering prayer.

58
00:02:50.333 --> 00:02:53.333
All of this calms the mind,

59
00:02:53.333 --> 00:02:54.708
but at the same time

60
00:02:54.708 --> 00:02:56.500
awakens within us, for Lord Krishna,

61
00:02:56.500 --> 00:02:57.166
love

62
00:02:57.166 --> 00:03:00.875
and a deep longing to attain Him.

63
00:03:00.875 --> 00:03:04.083
And this is true spiritual wealth.

64
00:03:04.083 --> 00:03:07.541
Lord Krishna's message is very simple.

65
00:03:07.541 --> 00:03:11.541
Simply keep practising devotion regularly,

66
00:03:11.541 --> 00:03:14.833
and you will naturally begin
to be drawn toward Me.

67
00:03:14.833 --> 00:03:16.250
And just walking along this way,

68
00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:17.541
you will then attain

69
00:03:17.541 --> 00:03:20.291
the highest level of devotion too.

70
00:03:20.291 --> 00:03:23.541
Just as a child keeps trying,

71
00:03:23.541 --> 00:03:26.208
and then one day begins to walk on their own,

72
00:03:26.208 --> 00:03:27.833
and then begins to run,

73
00:03:27.833 --> 00:03:30.458
in the same way we too, through regular

74
00:03:30.458 --> 00:03:31.458
practice of devotion,

75
00:03:31.458 --> 00:03:33.875
will learn to keep our mind

76
00:03:33.875 --> 00:03:35.791
fixed in Lord Krishna.

77
00:03:35.791 --> 00:03:38.708
What an encouraging message this is,

78
00:03:38.708 --> 00:03:40.291
that wherever we are,

79
00:03:40.291 --> 00:03:42.958
at whatever level of devotion we may be,

80
00:03:42.958 --> 00:03:44.958
through a little steady practice,

81
00:03:44.958 --> 00:03:47.416
all of us can make progress,

82
00:03:47.416 --> 00:03:49.291
on the path of devotion.

83
00:03:53.583 --> 00:03:57.125
Achieving mastery

84
00:03:57.125 --> 00:03:59.583
or skill in any work

85
00:03:59.583 --> 00:04:02.541
is not possible overnight.

86
00:04:02.541 --> 00:04:07.000
It requires continuous effort.

87
00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:11.000
Whether learning a new skill or an art –

88
00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:14.500
for example, learning to play the veena,

89
00:04:14.500 --> 00:04:17.166
or learning a language,

90
00:04:17.166 --> 00:04:20.000
or excelling in a sport –

91
00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:24.458
Mastery and progress in all of these

92
00:04:24.458 --> 00:04:29.250
will come only and only through
regular practice.

93
00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:32.666
Like a small child

94
00:04:32.666 --> 00:04:37.041
who is learning to ride a bicycle.

95
00:04:37.041 --> 00:04:39.625
In the beginning they fall,

96
00:04:39.625 --> 00:04:42.416
they get hurt too.

97
00:04:42.416 --> 00:04:44.916
Then the falling stops,

98
00:04:44.916 --> 00:04:50.000
but the balance still wavers.

99
00:04:50.000 --> 00:04:53.833
And gradually, one day,

100
00:04:53.833 --> 00:04:59.250
they ride the bicycle so effortlessly that it is as if

101
00:04:59.250 --> 00:05:03.500
it has become a part of their nature.

102
00:05:03.500 --> 00:05:05.416
In the same way,

103
00:05:05.416 --> 00:05:07.000
in life too,

104
00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:10.250
whether your goal is professional,

105
00:05:10.250 --> 00:05:13.458
personal, or spiritual,

106
00:05:13.458 --> 00:05:16.000
the first few steps

107
00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:19.958
will certainly feel difficult, but

108
00:05:19.958 --> 00:05:23.333
do not let the mind become discouraged by this.

109
00:05:23.333 --> 00:05:27.000
All of this is teaching you,

110
00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:30.333
strengthening you.

111
00:05:30.333 --> 00:05:34.041
You simply keep walking regularly.

112
00:05:34.041 --> 00:05:35.750
And yes,

113
00:05:35.750 --> 00:05:41.250
as far as devotion is concerned, if your mind

114
00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:42.625
is not yet

115
00:05:42.625 --> 00:05:46.000
fully able to settle on Me,

116
00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:48.708
even then do not worry.

117
00:05:48.708 --> 00:05:53.291
Simply, step by step, in small

118
00:05:53.291 --> 00:05:57.208
acts of devotion spend regular time,

119
00:05:57.208 --> 00:05:59.875
and then in a little while

120
00:05:59.875 --> 00:06:03.500
your mind will naturally

121
00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:06.083
begin to settle in Me.

122
00:06:06.083 --> 00:06:10.916
What once seemed difficult, through effort,

123
00:06:10.916 --> 00:06:12.541
that very thing, one day,

124
00:06:12.541 --> 00:06:16.833
becoming your nature does not take long.

125
00:06:16.833 --> 00:06:19.375
Whether it is devotion,

126
00:06:19.375 --> 00:06:22.166
a skill or an art,

127
00:06:22.166 --> 00:06:25.041
or any other aspect of life.

128
00:06:29.791 --> 00:06:31.750
Whatever thing

129
00:06:31.750 --> 00:06:36.916
or habit you repeatedly come into contact with,

130
00:06:36.916 --> 00:06:38.750
gradually

131
00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.208
your desires too

132
00:06:41.208 --> 00:06:45.416
begin to incline in that direction.

133
00:06:45.416 --> 00:06:48.041
You will have seen this too –

134
00:06:48.041 --> 00:06:51.500
if small children are continuously engaged

135
00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:55.916
with colourful programmes and devices,

136
00:06:55.916 --> 00:06:59.458
they become captivated by them.

137
00:06:59.458 --> 00:07:03.083
This habit deepens over time.

138
00:07:03.083 --> 00:07:07.541
Whatever behaviour we repeat daily,

139
00:07:07.541 --> 00:07:12.416
that is what begins to shape our perspective.

140
00:07:12.416 --> 00:07:14.166
In the same way,

141
00:07:14.166 --> 00:07:17.083
if a family together

142
00:07:17.083 --> 00:07:21.250
stays engaged in devotion, such as

143
00:07:21.250 --> 00:07:25.041
chanting the name, reading scriptures,

144
00:07:25.041 --> 00:07:28.458
discussing spiritual topics,

145
00:07:28.458 --> 00:07:32.750
or contributing to the Lord’s service –

146
00:07:32.750 --> 00:07:40.166
then all these practices automatically awaken

147
00:07:40.166 --> 00:07:44.291
boundless love and attraction
for Me in the mind.

148
00:07:44.291 --> 00:07:46.541
and this very attraction

149
00:07:46.541 --> 00:07:51.500
becomes the support for spiritual progress.

150
00:07:51.500 --> 00:07:53.541
Even if in the beginning

151
00:07:53.541 --> 00:07:57.583
this interest is not strong,

152
00:07:57.583 --> 00:08:02.958
but if the surrounding environment
is supportive,

153
00:08:02.958 --> 00:08:06.958
and small steps begin to be taken,

154
00:08:06.958 --> 00:08:10.250
then the interest begins to grow stronger.

155
00:08:10.250 --> 00:08:15.333
Many parents worry about why their children

156
00:08:15.333 --> 00:08:19.708
why their children, more than spirituality,

157
00:08:19.708 --> 00:08:23.375
are more drawn to entertainment,

158
00:08:23.375 --> 00:08:27.375
external attractions, or devices,
than to spirituality ?

159
00:08:27.375 --> 00:08:29.583
The answer is clear –

160
00:08:29.583 --> 00:08:32.125
whatever was given attention

161
00:08:32.125 --> 00:08:35.875
repeatedly, that is what settled in the mind.

162
00:08:35.875 --> 00:08:37.250
That is why,

163
00:08:37.250 --> 00:08:42.083
if you yourself follow good habits,

164
00:08:42.083 --> 00:08:45.750
at home create a supportive environment,

165
00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:51.125
let spirituality and devotion
take root in the home,

166
00:08:51.125 --> 00:08:54.791
then the new generation too will naturally

167
00:08:54.791 --> 00:08:57.541
be drawn in that direction.

168
00:08:57.541 --> 00:09:03.875
If today there is no deep feeling
of devotion in the mind,

169
00:09:03.875 --> 00:09:06.500
there is no need to worry.

170
00:09:06.500 --> 00:09:11.625
Simply begin with small habits.

171
00:09:11.625 --> 00:09:14.750
Give just a few minutes each day to spirituality

172
00:09:14.750 --> 00:09:21.791
devotion, or bhajan – regularly.

173
00:09:21.791 --> 00:09:25.041
Then watch – over time,

174
00:09:25.041 --> 00:09:29.958
this very thing will begin to
bring joy to your mind.

175
00:09:29.958 --> 00:09:35.250
The deep devotion whose absence was once felt,

176
00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:39.000
now that very thing will become,

177
00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:40.875
an inseparable part of your life.

178
00:09:45.375 --> 00:09:49.708
Attaining mastery in any field

179
00:09:49.708 --> 00:09:53.541
is not a matter of a single day.

180
00:09:53.541 --> 00:09:57.458
It comes through practice.

181
00:09:57.458 --> 00:10:00.958
Through regular effort,

182
00:10:00.958 --> 00:10:03.791
by learning from mistakes,

183
00:10:03.791 --> 00:10:07.458
and by refining your skill.

184
00:10:07.458 --> 00:10:12.041
When you step into a new field,

185
00:10:12.041 --> 00:10:16.916
in the beginning everything seems difficult.

186
00:10:16.916 --> 00:10:20.000
Sometimes even impossible.

187
00:10:20.000 --> 00:10:23.208
But with continuous practice,

188
00:10:23.208 --> 00:10:25.833
confidence begins to grow.

189
00:10:25.833 --> 00:10:30.375
The work that once created fear in the mind,

190
00:10:30.375 --> 00:10:35.541
now that very thing begins to feel natural.

191
00:10:35.541 --> 00:10:39.958
This is true not only for professional success,

192
00:10:39.958 --> 00:10:42.916
but for spiritual progress

193
00:10:42.916 --> 00:10:44.458
as well.

194
00:10:44.458 --> 00:10:46.291
If you,

195
00:10:46.291 --> 00:10:48.875
in the midst of your work,

196
00:10:48.875 --> 00:10:51.291
take out a few moments

197
00:10:51.291 --> 00:10:52.708
and the mind

198
00:10:52.708 --> 00:10:56.875
practise fixing in My remembrance,

199
00:10:56.875 --> 00:11:00.583
then this remembrance will deepen.

200
00:11:00.583 --> 00:11:03.666
Just as every effort takes you toward mastery

201
00:11:03.666 --> 00:11:09.708
in work or business,

202
00:11:09.708 --> 00:11:11.583
in the same way

203
00:11:11.583 --> 00:11:15.958
such small efforts made in devotion too

204
00:11:15.958 --> 00:11:19.916
draw you toward Me.

205
00:11:19.916 --> 00:11:24.958
Many people abandon their
efforts for this reason,

206
00:11:24.958 --> 00:11:29.958
because they do not see immediate results.

207
00:11:29.958 --> 00:11:33.041
But remember this –

208
00:11:33.041 --> 00:11:35.750
one who keeps making the effort continuously,

209
00:11:35.750 --> 00:11:38.125
their growth is certain.

210
00:11:38.125 --> 00:11:41.625
So if today you are not there

211
00:11:41.625 --> 00:11:44.625
where you wish to reach,

212
00:11:44.625 --> 00:11:46.625
do not worry.

213
00:11:46.625 --> 00:11:50.500
Keep making the effort and keep practising.

214
00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:56.708
Success will come in the professional
field, and in devotion too.
